// A large old cherry tree close to the camera, its trunk rising from (0, 0) at the bottom
// edge of a frame and its limbs spreading up and to the right. It is grown as branching limbs
// that taper toward the tips, with blossom only on the outer twigs: small clumps of flowers
// with gaps between them, a darker back layer with a few leaves behind the twigs, sunlit front
// clumps, and dithered, half-transparent flowers at the edges. The twigs and blossom stir in
// the wind; the trunk stays still.

use "fuji-palette.kdl"

scene "sakura-tree" palette="fuji" width=260 height=190 fps=12 duration="16s" background="sky-day.5" {
    camera x=-40 y=-180

    group "sway" x="=round(wind(0) * 1.5)"
